---
layout: null
---
{%- comment -%}
Consumer: the source-analysis service (external/source_analysis, APP_LIST_URL in
config.mjs), fetched on every run. Everything in api/ is read by software outside
the site; keep fields stable and tell the consumer's owner before changing them.

Which wallets exist and where their source lives. Only appId, platform and
repository on purpose; the analyser reads versions from the repository itself,
the site's version field lags. Records without a repository are left out. Apps
that are gone (removed, defunct, discontinued, deprecated) carry "gone":true:
one pulled from a store can still ship elsewhere, and a reproducible one stays
in the analyser's scope.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mobilePlatforms = "android,iphone" | split: "," -%}
{%- assign platforms = "desktop,hardware,bearer" | split: "," -%}
{%- assign goneMetas = "removed,defunct,discontinued,deprecated" | split: "," -%}
{%- assign out = "" -%}
{%- comment -%} _mobile records nest one block per store: android: {appId, repository, meta}, iphone: {...} {%- endcomment -%}
{%- for post in site.mobile -%}
{%- for platform in mobilePlatforms -%}
{%- assign store = post[platform] -%}
{%- assign repo = store.repository | strip -%}
{%- if store.appId and repo != "" -%}
{%- assign appIdJson = store.appId | jsonify -%}
{%- assign repoJson = repo | jsonify -%}
{%- assign out = out | append: ',{"appId":' | append: appIdJson | append: ',"platform":"' | append: platform | append: '","repository":' | append: repoJson -%}
{%- if goneMetas contains store.meta -%}{%- assign out = out | append: ',"gone":true' -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign out = out | append: '}' -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- for platform in platforms -%}
{%- for post in site[platform] -%}
{%- assign repo = post.repository | strip -%}
{%- if repo != "" -%}
{%- assign appIdJson = post.appId | jsonify -%}
{%- assign repoJson = repo | jsonify -%}
{%- assign out = out | append: ',{"appId":' | append: appIdJson | append: ',"platform":"' | append: platform | append: '","repository":' | append: repoJson -%}
{%- if goneMetas contains post.meta -%}{%- assign out = out | append: ',"gone":true' -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign out = out | append: '}' -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endfor -%}
[{{ out | remove_first: "," }}]
